{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19833","headline":"伤时 · 孟郊","name":"伤时","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"常闻贫贱士之常，嗟尔富者莫相笑。\n男儿得路即荣名，邂逅失途成不调。\n古人结交而重义，今人结交而重利。\n劝人一种种桃李，种亦直须遍天地。\n一生不爱嘱人事，嘱即直须爲生死。\n我亦不羡季伦富，我亦不笑原宪贫。\n有财有势即相识，无财无势同路人。\n因知世事皆如此，却向东溪卧白云。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19833.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19833","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}